use flake
# Two warnings of the host exobrain CLI. Each exits 0 and changes nothing.
# `outdated` warns about an old nixpkgs pin, a newer release of a
# tag-pinned flake input, a newer exobrain CLI, and newer hook-set
# revisions. `store-guard` warns, once a day, about working-tree copies in
# the Nix store.
exobrain outdated || true
exobrain store-guard --daily || true
